Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Note,,0,0,0,,----------------- Insert ----------------
Dialogue: 6,0:17:53.09,0:17:59.23,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}If you give me something
Dialogue: 6,0:17:59.92,0:18:06.57,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}How do I give this back?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:07.18,0:18:14.45,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I can't imagine what it is
Dialogue: 6,0:18:14.45,0:18:20.98,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}But still it may fill you
Dialogue: 6,0:18:22.23,0:18:28.53,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}If I give you something
Dialogue: 6,0:18:29.26,0:18:35.13,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}How will you give this back?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:35.50,0:18:43.62,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I am not greedy but I hope we're equal
Dialogue: 6,0:18:43.62,0:18:49.72,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Did it mean I was greedy?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:01.30,0:19:08.34,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}When did I get it wrong?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:11.33,0:19:18.56,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Is that your kindness? Or your way of leaving?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:18.98,0:19:25.28,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I just can't see your heart
Dialogue: 6,0:19:25.90,0:19:33.03,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Now maybe I know everything about you
Dialogue: 6,0:19:33.54,0:19:40.23,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}So why do you still feel so far?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.93,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I just
Dialogue: 6,0:19:46.22,0:19:52.14,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Tried to save you now
Dialogue: 6,0:20:02.91,0:20:09.44,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}So what was the love we had
Dialogue: 6,0:20:10.07,0:20:15.93,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I can't give it a name
Dialogue: 6,0:20:16.30,0:20:24.16,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I know it was a lie but somehow true
Dialogue: 6,0:20:24.52,0:20:30.39,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Such a strange thing it was
Dialogue: 6,0:20:32.20,0:20:40.14,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}It's time for me to go
Dialogue: 6,0:20:49.46,0:20:57.30,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5\t(2000,3200,\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&)}That was your kindness and your way of leaving
Dialogue: 6,0:20:57.30,0:21:03.31,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Now I finally know
Dialogue: 6,0:21:04.12,0:21:11.71,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}At last I know everything about you
Dialogue: 6,0:21:11.71,0:21:18.65,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}That means it's really over now
Dialogue: 6,0:21:19.01,0:21:22.65,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Goodbye
Dialogue: 6,0:21:28.27,0:21:38.29,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}May you find peace
Dialogue: 7,0:17:53.09,0:17:59.23,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}若你曾予我
Dialogue: 7,0:17:59.92,0:18:06.57,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我以何还德?
Dialogue: 7,0:18:07.18,0:18:14.45,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我无法想象它的轮廓
Dialogue: 7,0:18:14.45,0:18:20.98,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}可它能填补你的{\bord4\blur3\1a&HFF&\3c&HCCC69F&}空壳
Dialogue: 7,0:18:22.23,0:18:28.53,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}若我曾予你
Dialogue: 7,0:18:29.26,0:18:35.13,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}你可会还抵?
Dialogue: 7,0:18:35.50,0:18:43.62,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我无所觊  只求彼此相齐
Dialogue: 7,0:18:43.62,0:18:49.72,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}难道是我起了贪意?
Dialogue: 7,0:19:01.30,0:19:08.34,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我何时会错了意?
Dialogue: 7,0:19:11.33,0:19:18.56,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}那是你的温柔? 还是离开前的施舍?
Dialogue: 7,0:19:18.98,0:19:25.28,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我看不透你的心河
Dialogue: 7,0:19:25.90,0:19:33.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}如今我似乎已读懂你的本色
Dialogue: 7,0:19:33.54,0:19:40.23,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}可为何你我仍如悬隔?
Dialogue: 7,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.93,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我只是
Dialogue: 7,0:19:46.22,0:19:52.14,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}试图救你于此刻
Dialogue: 7,0:20:02.91,0:20:09.44,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我们曾有过的爱意
Dialogue: 7,0:20:10.07,0:20:15.93,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我竟无法定义
Dialogue: 7,0:20:16.30,0:20:24.16,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}明知是谎言  却掺着几许真实
Dialogue: 7,0:20:24.52,0:20:30.39,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}如此荒谬如戏
Dialogue: 7,0:20:32.20,0:20:40.14,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我也该就此别过
Dialogue: 7,0:20:49.46,0:20:57.30,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5\t(2000,3200,\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&)}那是你的温柔  也是离开前的施舍
Dialogue: 7,0:20:57.30,0:21:03.31,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}而今我才悟彻
Dialogue: 7,0:21:04.12,0:21:11.71,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我终于读懂你的{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&}本色
Dialogue: 7,0:21:11.71,0:21:18.65,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}也是故事完结的时刻
Dialogue: 7,0:21:19.01,0:21:22.65,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}再见
Dialogue: 7,0:21:28.27,0:21:38.29,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H32&\3a&H3C&}{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}愿你寻得安宁
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Note,,0,0,0,,----------------- OP ----------------
Dialogue: 6,0:00:07.45,0:00:13.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}怪しいわ　私を放ったりして
Dialogue: 6,0:00:13.83,0:00:17.46,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}理解してないトラウマ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:17.46,0:00:22.38,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}何を彼に祈んのそもそも
Dialogue: 6,0:00:22.38,0:00:25.80,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ねえ笑って見せても
Dialogue: 6,0:00:25.80,0:00:29.51,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}きっと信じないでしょ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:29.51,0:00:37.43,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}問題ないふりして　地面を蹴り泣く
Dialogue: 6,0:00:37.43,0:00:43.40,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Test me　どうせ死ぬなら　chase me
Dialogue: 6,0:00:43.40,0:00:47.69,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}行くか　死ぬか　tell me　教えてnow
Dialogue: 6,0:00:47.69,0:00:52.53,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}絡むな　変に　終わらせるこのカルマ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:52.53,0:00:58.08,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Test me　どうせ死ぬなら　chase me
Dialogue: 6,0:00:58.08,0:01:02.46,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}行くか　死ぬか　tell me　教えてnow
Dialogue: 6,0:01:02.46,0:01:05.71,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}絡むな　変に
Dialogue: 6,0:01:06.88,0:01:12.93,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Test me　どうせ死ぬなら　chase me
Dialogue: 6,0:01:12.93,0:01:17.22,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}行くか　死ぬか　tell me　教えてnow
Dialogue: 6,0:01:17.22,0:01:24.61,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}絡むな　変に　終わらせるこのカルマ
Dialogue: 7,0:00:07.45,0:00:13.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}真奇怪  竟将我扔下不顾
Dialogue: 7,0:00:13.83,0:00:17.46,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}那无法理解的创伤
Dialogue: 7,0:00:17.46,0:00:22.38,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}说起来  我到底在向他祈求什么
Dialogue: 7,0:00:22.38,0:00:25.80,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}就算我展露笑容
Dialogue: 7,0:00:25.80,0:00:29.51,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}你也一定不会相信吧
Dialogue: 7,0:00:29.51,0:00:37.43,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只能假装没事  顿足痛哭
Dialogue: 7,0:00:37.43,0:00:43.40,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Test me  反正终有一死  chase me
Dialogue: 7,0:00:43.40,0:00:47.69,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}是前进  还是死去  tell me  告诉我now
Dialogue: 7,0:00:47.69,0:00:52.53,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}别再扭曲纠缠  让我终结这场宿命
Dialogue: 7,0:00:52.53,0:00:58.08,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Test me  反正终有一死  chase me
